Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production (@industrial-chemistry: 0, is #chapter, #industrial-chemistry "foundations/Read-industrial-chemistry-from-zero.lingua#r_55A3W30FEJDN1MYDPYFMVNYTME") { r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618
Understand how raw and recovered materials become useful chemical products. Begin with familiar objects, chemical language, quantities, feed evidence and specifications. Deepen through species/element and energy accounts, thermodynamics, kinetics/catalysis, transport/reactors, separation, inorganic/organic and renewable/specialty families, analytical quality, operation, transfers and recovery.

Start with [Read from familiar chemical products to complete processes and independent scholarship](foundations/Read-industrial-chemistry-from-zero.lingua#r_55A3W30FEJDN1MYDPYFMVNYTME). [Complete substantial chemical-technology books, university work and connected process studies](research/A-sustained-industrial-chemistry-reading-and-practice-programme.lingua#r_5JE464G1MT1B1153AD87X7JS90) supplies the substantial complete book/course progression and later practical/academic studies. [Industrial chemistry sources — whole books, courses, technical methods and primary evidence](Sources.lingua#r_3084780FHMK499ZDAW07TYA3TQ) identifies actual editions, open licences, freely readable copyrighted works, optional commercial books and inspection/access limits. Each next step supplies the particular explanation, calculation or primary reading needed.

**Products, feed and accounts:** [Begin with a useful chemical product and the work that gives it its properties](foundations/A-product-and-the-chemistry-that-makes-it.lingua#r_0E0P0DQW2WSW99ENJSBQNFH01B), [Use industrial chemical language with an explicit substance, operation and basis](foundations/Reaction-operation-feed-intermediate-and-product-language.lingua#r_64314EV3Y9ZKDEEWWSZXQFP5AB), [State chemical quantities, composition, purity and throughput on a usable basis](foundations/Amount-composition-purity-throughput-and-time.lingua#r_3VZAMY6D4469SV1678W5B3JS5T), [Characterize feed variability for the actual chemistry and process response](feedstocks/Characterize-a-feed-for-its-chemical-and-physical-response.lingua#r_4SGD9MAA6F3FBXHX5JR40TWWWM), [Translate chemical usefulness into identity, composition, physical form and acceptance evidence](feedstocks/Define-a-usable-chemical-product-and-its-evidence.lingua#r_535PMG683E3954QDWW0ERTPYG8), [Read a flowsheet as connected chemical transformations, separation duties and inventories](processes/Read-and-reconstruct-chemical-flowsheets.lingua#r_3YXSFY4TWHFHPMZ3N8HBXQC0J8), [Choose a process boundary and test what its equations can determine](balances/Boundaries-inventory-time-and-degrees-of-freedom.lingua#r_2Z2N5W5E8P521QTHQB13KE4R97), [Close element accounts while allowing species, phases and useful products to change](balances/Conserved-elements-streams-and-chemical-transformation.lingua#r_71NDSP7R3M8W3B7511NVQ4HW6V), [Represent a reaction network with extents and independent chemical constraints](balances/Reaction-networks-extents-and-independent-constraints.lingua#r_25NVZFRFZNBVKYDCXPAA04Z95X), [Distinguish reactant conversion, selectivity, isolated yield and accepted output](balances/Conversion-selectivity-isolated-yield-and-usable-output.lingua#r_59JNS3Q481HSMKY7ZHFFVJFVG6), [Explain why recycle, purge and fresh-feed accounts must be solved together](balances/Recycle-purge-and-accumulation-in-a-process-loop.lingua#r_4JBQH57WVMDA799QCG1KNDRQGV), [Verify a recycle and purge account with exact quantities and independent balances](balances/An-inspectable-recycle-and-purge-account.lingua#r_7DBH60P2MM84PVRAC802SEW9KZ), [Build a chemical-process energy account from states, reactions and work](balances/Heat-work-phase-change-and-reaction-energy.lingua#r_7XJ8R69XAXCCCTMAEXWPSKXEP0) and [Distinguish energy quantity, temperature level, entropy and useful work](balances/Energy-quality-entropy-and-minimum-separation-work.lingua#r_6KQ9H7SJ6V4QVR5QF3T2WSHQ0M).

**Thermodynamic and reaction models:** [Use reaction equilibrium with explicit activities, phases and industrial conditions](thermodynamics/Reaction-equilibria-reference-states-and-industrial-conditions.lingua#r_2XXQE3QHDAXNBB258QPPVSAKRV), [Connect mixture phase equilibria with stable states and actual separation duties](thermodynamics/Mixtures-phases-and-stability-in-industrial-separations.lingua#r_77RX7N6YCX25E5PTTMHQ7X9ZRQ), [Select and test property models against the material state and evidence](thermodynamics/Select-test-and-version-chemical-property-models.lingua#r_78B24XST7VWY2R1H9F0HRWSPHB), [Verify a bounded flash calculation with independent phase and component checks](separations/An-inspectable-fixed-ratio-flash.lingua#r_4C2KA2E8NSHG5XJGQM45H58FQV), [Read chemical models as functions, rates, accumulated quantities and constrained systems](models/Functions-derivatives-integrals-and-changing-chemical-inventories.lingua#r_2YY1EB9SY930JF2MPSBSCZB4HG), [Infer chemical rates from a defined experiment and test competing mechanisms](kinetics/Rate-laws-mechanisms-parameters-and-evidence.lingua#r_0YJBZ45WHB3M0N4ZA64MKE4KAE), [Explain catalytic performance through actual catalyst state, selectivity and lifetime](kinetics/Catalyst-state-selectivity-poisoning-and-regeneration.lingua#r_5W2DGJAXJA6FE0744B3XTVR3YY), [Connect competing reaction pathways with residence history and product isolation](kinetics/Parallel-consecutive-reactions-and-where-to-stop.lingua#r_499NJSB210KGRFY8AFS5PE131S), [Verify consecutive-reaction yield in a series of well-mixed reactors](kinetics/An-inspectable-consecutive-reaction-cascade.lingua#r_6PCPV66ZAVPT85HWCSPVED46HY), [Model batch and semi-batch chemistry with feed history, inventory and thermal response](reactors/Batch-semi-batch-addition-and-changing-inventories.lingua#r_0XQR509GVT9DHKFW280V98DMAJ), [Compare continuous reactor arrangements through balances and useful product](reactors/Stirred-flow-and-packed-bed-reactor-accounts.lingua#r_4ZM75C2HFZY6FZWDMQE26ENGXJ), [Test how heat, mass transfer and mixing alter apparent industrial chemistry](reactors/Separate-intrinsic-chemistry-from-transport-and-scale.lingua#r_745N06VN734S3C4NT51NRCB52J), [Infer residence histories and test whether an ideal reactor model fits the evidence](reactors/Residence-time-distributions-bypass-and-mixing-models.lingua#r_54MXGD8AKQ76G6PEC1MC2WPWY1), [Distinguish a thermal steady state, its stability and the trajectory reaching it](reactors/Nonisothermal-steady-states-stability-and-transients.lingua#r_20YMRWMPPJ12WQBT3M9ZSBKAZK), [Measure reaction heat and accumulation before extending a process argument](reactors/Calorimetry-accumulation-quench-and-thermal-evidence.lingua#r_780HSC98AC6KFVKCBJ7N55T5JT), [Explain multiphase reaction performance through contacting, transfer and chemical state](reactors/Gas-liquid-solid-contact-phases-and-catalyst-particles.lingua#r_68XDTKFBYC0AJ6RPE6DWNMRE2R) and [Connect biological production with feed, growth, reaction and downstream recovery](reactors/Biological-conversion-growth-and-product-formation.lingua#r_4EYZCGRS2W6887Y0YMPS6YW4SM).

**Separation and integrated duties:** [Design a separation argument around the complete reaction and product account](separations/Reaction-and-separation-as-one-product-system.lingua#r_06SY3Y27KN4FR3EW1WFX3V1BZ0), [Connect distillation with phase behavior, finite stages, recovery and heat duties](separations/Distillation-volatility-stages-reflux-and-energy.lingua#r_03PTYEGR2X76HT9RBYBK813RVS), [Explain gas absorption and stripping through equilibrium, transfer and solvent fate](separations/Gas-absorption-stripping-and-reactive-contact.lingua#r_69KHFNVHF37DSKEHW5DNJKKA78), [Evaluate liquid extraction with actual partition, finite phases and solvent recovery](separations/Liquid-extraction-selectivity-solvents-and-staging.lingua#r_78X0A79WGSPRMBEH16G2MCDN5G), [Follow selective separations through capacity, transport, regeneration and waste](separations/Adsorption-ion-exchange-membranes-and-regeneration.lingua#r_794F81FPAZEEDBSKVX4T3EHNFM), [Connect crystallization with phase relations, particle populations and impurity fate](separations/Crystallization-nucleation-growth-and-chemical-purity.lingua#r_0NRN1K5ADPNX1GKMYG749S46RJ), [Account for solids separation, washing, drying and the material delivered](separations/Filtration-washing-drying-and-physical-product-state.lingua#r_74FDG721Y6Q0HQGAJS6JSXTCYC) and [Match process heat duties at compatible temperatures and operating times](utilities/Temperature-levels-heat-exchange-and-integrated-duties.lingua#r_0AB2T3N3JWJY8FF9KR5CDBJCNB).

